plusaudio-audio/
*.apkg

# ...except the starter deck's, which are source, not generated content.
# They are the one set of clips amgi ships rather than makes, because the
# people they exist for are exactly the people with no key to make them
# with (see server/amgi/starter.c). Rebuilt by
# scripts/build-starter-audio.js.
!anki/starter/media/*.mp3
